    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37214" root="كمت" body-key="k">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَمُتَ</span></b> , (contr. to analogy, as verbs significant of colours [if unaugmented] are generally
of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعِلٌ</span>, MF,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَمُتَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَمْتٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُمْتَةٌ</span> (in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَمْتَةٌ</span>) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَمَاتَةٌ</span>; and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكمت</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِكْمَاتٌ</span>; (K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكمتّ</span></b> ,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِكْمِتَاتٌ</span>; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكماتّ</span></b> , (in the CK
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِكْمَأَتَّ</span>,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِكْمِيتَاتٌ</span>; (S, K;) <i>He</i> (a horse,
S, K, [and a camel, &amp;c.]) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, of the
colour called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُمَيْتٌ</span>. (S, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَمَتَ الغَيْظَ</span>,
[aor, 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَمُتَ</span></b> ,] <i>He concealed,</i> or <i>hid in his bosom, rage,</i>
or <i>wrath.</i> (Sgh, K.)

